## Performance & Bundling

### Recommendations

- Route-based code splitting; lazy load heavy pages and widgets.
- Avoid heavy libs in core UI; prefer lightweight, tree-shakeable dependencies.
- Use modern image formats (WebP/AVIF); serve responsive sizes.

### Observability

- ✅ Web Vitals reporting via `src/core/perf/reportWebVitals.ts`. Tracks Core Web Vitals (LCP, INP, CLS, FCP, TTFB) and currently logs through `@infra/logging/loggerAdapter`. Extend it by adding adapters under a new `src/infrastructure/observability/*` folder if you need to forward metrics to external systems.
